WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.375
[MUSIC]

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:08.350
Hey, so, Jenny, thank you so
much for being here with us today.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:09.010
&gt;&gt; Thanks.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.310
&gt;&gt; It's a real honor to have you here.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.210
And as you know, there's a slight
